      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "This functionality of this delegate method is equivalent to overriding [`UITableView`](uitableview.md) class’s [`preferredFocusedView`](uifocusguide/preferredfocusedview.md) method in the [`UIFocusEnvironment`](uifocusenvironment.md) protocol.",
      "normalizedSource": "This functionality of this delegate method is equivalent to overriding [`UITableView`](uitableview.md) class’s [`preferredFocusedView`](uifocusguide/preferredfocusedview.md) method in the [`UIFocusEnvironment`](uifocusenvironment.md) protocol.",
