      "sourceHash": "c44b778a999046b18e24d5ba52b2d2072b86a3e44d6baa40ea0c9f1dd0212076",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If the [`UITableView`](uitableview.md) class’s [`remembersLastFocusedIndexPath`](uitableview/rememberslastfocusedindexpath.md) method is set to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), this method defines the index path that gets focused when the table view is focused for the first time.",
